# Sonar / a11y

- **S3358:** no nested ternaries → `if`/`else if` (`describedBy`, field messages)
- Prefer `arr.at(-1)` over `[length-1]`
- No `aria-invalid` on `<button>`; use `aria-describedby` → `role="alert"`
- Custom selects: no `role="listbox"`/`option"`; use `aria-haspopup`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-pressed`
- No JSX handlers on `<dialog>`, `<tr>`, non-interactive divs
- `<dialog>` click/cancel: `addEventListener` in `useEffect` (`ConfirmDialog`, `Modal`)
- Backdrop dismiss = real `<button>`
- Extract helpers vs giant components; avoid prop→state sync in effects when avoidable
- OTP: `<fieldset>`/`<legend>`; calendar cells: stable ids/keys
